This decline contrasts with the broader market, where the S&P 500 and NASDAQ have both seen modest gains. Investors have been cautious, with Meta’s stock underperforming the tech sector overall. Key factors influencing this trend include concerns over user growth, regulatory challenges, and the uncertainty surrounding the long-term viability of the metaverse.  

